H 800
	\b\cr>>>WARNING: OPEN SINGLE PLAYER ENABLED<<<\B\C
	
	You are about to start Mission 13 in \bOpen Single Player\B mode. This mode breaks Mission 13 entirely. If you proceed, the story campaign will abruptly stop and your ship will be replaced with a Starflier.
	
	To play Mission 13 normally, please reinstall \bFreelancer: HD Edition\B and make sure the installer option \bSingle Player mode\B is set to \bStory Mode (default)\B. A save file has been created so that after reinstalling, you can continue where you left off.


